SUMMARY:The Womack Sisters
LOCATION:Royale\, 279 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116
DESCRIPTION:The Womack Sisters Kucha\, Zeimani\, and BG Womack were singing
  before they could walk. They grew up on the road. Their schools were stag
 es and studios all over the world\, where they sang behind their parents\,
  Zekkariyas & Zeriiya (fka Womack & Womack)\, alongside their four sibling
 s. Nowhere was home for long. No matter where they lived—London\, Thaila
 nd\, Amsterdam\, Kenya\, Paris\, Sydney\, Zurich\, Vienna\, Tanzania\, New
  York\, Miami\, West Virginia\, the Bahamas—they were always surrounded 
 by music and family.\nhttps://www.axs.com/events/1641306/the-womack-sister
 s-tickets\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://www.axs.com/events/1641306/the-womack-sisters-tickets
